B.a7R=A.a(s(["You're here! That makes me happy.","Look at us, growing together.","Good to see you again."]),t.s)
B.a8N=A.a(s(["I was resting. Glad you're back.","No pressure \u2014 I'll be here.","Quiet days are okay too."]),t.s)
B.a9s=A.a(s(["You came back twice! I love it.","We're on a roll \u2014 gently.","This is fun. Thank you."]),t.s)
B.a94=A.a(s(["Nice and easy. That's the way.","Steady is just as good as fast.","I feel calm when you're here."]),t.s)
